OL,3,ABonnie Tyler Christmas single to be
OL,4,Areleased as husband says he misses her
OL,5,Aevery day
OL,6,
OL,7,FBonnie Tyler's husband said it has
OL,8,F"been a heartbreaking year" following
OL,9,Fher death and that he misses her "every
OL,10,Fsingle day".
OL,12,FTyler, born Gaynor Hopkins, died in
OL,13,FJuly aged 75 after undergoing emergency
OL,14,Fintestinal surgery in Portugal earlier
OL,15,Fthis year.
OL,17,FThe Total Eclipse of the Heart singer's
OL,18,Flast studio recording, Love, Light and
OL,19,FPeace, will be released as a Christmas
OL,20,Fsingle on 13 November 2026.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
