OL,3,ABonnie Tyler Christmas single to be
OL,4,Areleased as husband says he misses her
OL,5,Aevery day
OL,6,
OL,7,FTyler's husband of 50 years, Robert
OL,8,FSullivan, said: "Gaynor never stopped
OL,9,Fworking. She loved singing, she loved
OL,10,Fher fans, and she poured her whole
OL,11,Fheart into these songs."
